Subject: [PATCH] feat: DSG Verified Execution Gate v2

Replace the readiness-probe contract with a proof-receipt contract backed by
Cinema /verify/evaluate and exact Z3 verification.

- action.yml: ALLOW/REVIEW/BLOCK decision, no permissive defaults on any of the
  six execution assertions, optional api_key for metered attribution
- scripts/verified-execution.sh: writes dsg-proof-receipt.json, surfaces
  decision/proof_hash/context_hash/remediation
- MIGRATION.md: v1 to v2 mapping; v1 tags stay immutable and unaffected
- README: lead with v2, retain v1 reference, drop the retired Vercel URL

